@siso/atoms compatibility root API — provenance
The compatibility root components and styles were independently authored for SISO. Actual upstream code in the separate source entry is documented below.
Arc inventory app/src/arc and the local uiarc registry were reviewed to identify families only.
The compatibility root copies no Arc code. Arc Pro, Kobra, Kinetics and HALO CRM source is not included anywhere in this package.
The initial local registry did not expose a licence; subsequent suite-owner verification established MIT for Arc free.
Existing MIT shadcn controls were inspected for compositional API conventions, not copied.
Runtime dependency radix-ui provides accessible tabs, tooltip and split-action menu behavior;
its MIT copyright and permission notice is supplied with that package and reproduced below.

